# Dictionary and ngrams

Sources (do not rewrite wholesale): `data/dictionary/words_dictionary.json`, `google-10000-english-no-swears.txt`, `data/seed-*.json`.

Runtime URLs: `src/data/languageAssets.ts` (ImageKit). Do not put these files in `public/`.

- Weight tweaks: `scripts/word-weight-overrides.json` then `npm run sync:weights`.
- `npm run build:dictionary` → `generated/dictionary.txt` (upload to ImageKit)
- `npm run build:ngrams` → `generated/prediction-ngrams.json` (upload to ImageKit)

`dev` / `build` do not regenerate these. Details: `data/dictionary/README.md`. Skill: `.cursor/skills/dictionary-weights/SKILL.md`.
